<h2 class="report-part" id="part-a">Part A: Image Warping and Mosaicing</h2>
<p>I estimated homographies from manually selected points, implemented inverse warping with nearest-neighbor and bilinear interpolation, and blended overlapping photos into mosaics. The images show my bedroom, kitchen, and the view outside my apartment.</p>
<section id="part-a-1"><h3>A.1: Shoot the Pictures</h3>
<p>I took two overlapping views of each scene. For matching points, I used poster corners in the bedroom, details on the fridge in the kitchen, and building corners outside.</p>
